[{"title":"次韵和端夫喜望之祈雪有应","author":"邹浩","text":"诚意通群祀，朝来忽已飘。\n六花纷汗漫，千里入均调。\n赵璧光凌日，隋珠暗掷宵。\n老农愁自判，稚子喜来娇。\n化育知难诘，形容岂易描。\n白盐聊比拟，黄竹谩讴谣。\n谈柄迷修麈，朝衣夺素貂。\n丰穰归嗣岁，收拾谢枯樵。\n浅露先生履，深齐惠可腰。\n思添韦应物，狂助盖宽饶。\n民食逃艰粒，宸心定解焦。\n楼高天构玉，池迥地疏瑶。\n爽韵陪松桧，严声陋鼓箫。\n亡羊空道路，失鹤但云霄。\n抚运年将往，侵人鬓欲凋。\n题舆真健笔，险句压寒绡。\n重愧非名士，兹焉缀下寮。\n主宾参沔渡，杖履集山椒。\n故事梁园在，风流楚国遥。\n琼瑰争报复，宇宙一漂摇。\n莫讶春来晚，春来待此消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57030,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵慎微雪","author":"邹浩","text":"万物归根后，端来兆物华。\n仙姿凝鹤氅，云路拥羊车。\n但喜天时正，宁知帝力加。\n有田皆玉粒，无树不琼花。\n浪说朱蹄马，空馀白首鸦。\n酒边深荐爽，阱处巧藏窊。\n径断回樵斧，波浑倚钓槎。\n高门委金帛，阴壑蜕龙蛇。\n功茂丰年谷，名喧好事茶。\n丛轻颓瓦竹，摇迥动签牙。\n蝶冷残初梦，蜂寒閟两衙。\n殷勤非俗韵，潇洒是生涯。\n火变人窥异，军潜夜肃哗。\n暗香迷绽蕊，新筑路平沙。\n寸食方从寄，扁舟未可拿。\n只应清兴在，犹似子猷家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57031,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和慎微雪夜饮归","author":"邹浩","text":"篮舆还自斗边城，雪夜乾坤分外清。\n我为捐书径眠去，寒光犹助一窗明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57032,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招颍昌曾存之","author":"邹浩","text":"荆山汉水雪边春，满眼风流见古人。\n领略此心谁与尽，从容高义势难亲。\n静摇庵影竹如昨，清弄池光梅欲新。\n知子相忘忘未得，禅床推倒就车轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57033,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"延庆山中呈田世德","author":"邹浩","text":"云拥招提自一家，僧前百鸟正衔花。\n长官不怕惊飞去，犹向山头放晚衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57034,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简仲益求纸帐","author":"邹浩","text":"红锦暖笼樽酒后，绛纱轻覆简书前。\n悬知纸帐君无用，斥与边韶助昼眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57035,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲益以帐来且有就榻眠之句复次韵与之","author":"邹浩","text":"茆屋初成亦可怜，更悬青帐小窗前。\n不嫌索寞无春梦，解使君心合眼眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57036,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕过唐潜亨 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"乾坤为室月为灯，今夕先生眼倍青。\n笑尽筌蹄聊把手，不知何处是中庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57037,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕过唐潜亨 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"藏拙堂深不浪开，夜光容我卷书来。\n梅花傲雪初无语，斗柄催春忽自回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57038,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕过唐潜亨 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"参禅不学庞居士，得句犹如孟浩然。\n要识从来用心处，阒无车马到门前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57039,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送谷隐呈同行诸公","author":"邹浩","text":"窈窕峰峦藏宝刹，峥嵘楼阁倚晴天。\n我来不问东西寺，径就僧堂借榻眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57040,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲益欲归作此留之","author":"邹浩","text":"关西关北渐芳菲，晓马凌春入翠微。\n山向吾曹正多思，不应揽辔屡言归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57041,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答端夫约春游","author":"邹浩","text":"分如松柏老相看，桃李风前共岁寒。\n只恐功名挽公去，一春能得几游盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57042,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答仲益见简","author":"邹浩","text":"镜里年华鬓未苍，春山且喜渐芬芳。\n功名富贵时来耳，底事灵台著庙堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57043,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和潜亨雪 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"暖律稽迟太史占，风前犹复弄威严。\n不妨豪客成樽俎，重使斯民困米盐。\n但见青峰皆玉笋，岂知白屋是茆檐。\n何人隐入群羊去，应笑痴儿认角尖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57044,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和潜亨雪 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"朝来一色换纷华，眩眼端如醉后车。\n岂待三年方楮叶，虽非八月亦芦花。\n李边照曜河南日，柳外缤纷靖节家。\n欲上云岩访禅老，路迷空想举长叉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57045,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒武侯道中 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"万株桑柘拥江城，中有梅花独自清。\n不近樽罍免攀折，会须结实助和羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57046,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒武侯道中 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"先生龙卧此山丘，宇宙曾经几运筹。\n一自英雄三顾后，至今车马不曾休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57047,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒武侯道中 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"万山山上塔擎天，万山山下碑沉渊。\n天光渊影晓相入，一碧万里青春前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57048,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒武侯道中 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"晚雨霏霏江上来，长江水色蒲萄醅。\n鸬鹚鸧鸹得意处，凌风荡桨从东回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57049,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒武侯道中 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"万山横出波面浮，山前舟楫凌飞鸥。\n遥看塔庙带残日，蓬莱方丈金鳌头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57050,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送香潜亨","author":"邹浩","text":"炙背轩楹日转时，博山炉顶驻游丝。\n先生妙与此心契，凭仗清香一解颐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57051,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答谢公靖节推将至襄阳见寄 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"不见紫芝今几年，朅来眉宇照山川。\n关南关北风流在，犹得时时一举鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57052,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答谢公靖节推将至襄阳见寄 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"宾主相忘沔水滨，高风谁与向来亲。\n君能鸡黍酬初诺，我亦齑盐得此春。\n桃李无言方永日，江山有路正宜人。\n直须弄凤骑龙去，莫使身为可畏身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57053,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送墨潜亨","author":"邹浩","text":"少室峰前松插天，栋梁馀力焕青编。\n东斋政欲捐书坐，往助子云成太玄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57054,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李拱之秀才还唐州","author":"邹浩","text":"真淡先生早杜门，三香亭上自乾坤。\n人间巧舌犹蜂起，子独抠衣识道尊。\n几日凯风吹户牖，只今归路指丘园。\n将分索我微言赠，欲赠微言无可言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57055,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送居政禅者游庐阜","author":"邹浩","text":"拄杖横担得自由，冷云飞雪下南州。\n殷勤要识庐山面，五老峰前一举头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57056,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月六日城外马上呈世德 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"岘山脚下江水生，普宁寺前舟楫行。\n细民无钱不得渡，老幼相持愁叹声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57057,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月六日城外马上呈世德 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"虎头凤麓连长堤，随山刊木路可为。\n长官仁政及物远，一时力役民忘疲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57058,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲益遽塞便门作此戏之","author":"邹浩","text":"闭门不啻似泄柳，排闼何由如舞阳。\n怜君肝胆便楚越，使我南北成参商。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57059,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢潜亨惠芸香紫桃","author":"邹浩","text":"暑窗已觉书生蠹，饥腹还惊雨后雷。\n珍重先生解人意，芸香桃实一时来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57060,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻存之游京师且邸报达官有荐之者","author":"邹浩","text":"昨来不肯听朝鸡，乞得真宫即日归。\n老衲蒲团閒共倚，少师玉麈醉同挥。\n谁知捷径嵩山在，未觉心驰魏阙非。\n绿鸭陂中钓竿手，只应从此叩黄扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57061,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"扫尽人间冰雪寒，鱼龙鳞甲动斑斓。\n向来协气无踪迹，从此氤氲满世还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57062,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"眼里飞蝇日夜侵，对时宁复壮年心。\n故人把手知难遇，强起禅冠插旧簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57063,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"天路幽禽暖颉颃，芝兰抽砌叶初长。\n自怜骨立风光里，勉向原头泣奉尝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57064,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"春声入鼓晓鼕鼕，春色盈花晚更红。\n陶冶东君了无意，一时分付与晴风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57065,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"冥心无物契毗耶，触处俱为剡水涯。\n却怪年来被春恼，逢人不觉叹浮家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57066,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其六","author":"邹浩","text":"青鞋布袜水云乡，胜践曾同物外忙。\n欲寄沃州双泪去，松阴高冢是星郎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57067,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其七","author":"邹浩","text":"南明山下枕清流，胸次尘无一点留。\n只恐少微黄色动，终然来作济川舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57068,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其八","author":"邹浩","text":"高水笼轩翠作行，枕书閒听雨浪浪。\n别来一念终难灭，犹得追论几席傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57069,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其九","author":"邹浩","text":"观象悬知岁有成，通宵格泽照天明。\n馀生饭饱无它事，坐看纷纷万物情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57070,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和师稷清明怀乡之什 其十","author":"邹浩","text":"三元甲子几回旋，前日沧溟今甫田。\n惟有交情似春寿，蟠桃花里自年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57071,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和永守丁葆光大夫对雪","author":"邹浩","text":"几日江云凝不流，欲将胜事一齐收。\n乾坤破夜端为昼，草木留春不复秋。\n黄竹作歌君得意，素娥行酒我消愁。\n须知身世尘埃尽，直到广寒宫里游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57072,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和葆光晚望","author":"邹浩","text":"雪晴新兴与春俱，脱略司空城旦书。\n衡岳带云回玉辇，楚江浮日动金鱼。\n故人情远欣相遇，梦境时来信所如。\n北阙遥瞻念图报，恩深犹在免诛锄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57073,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼","author":"邹浩","text":"岳阳楼上望重湖，混合乾坤入太虚。\n若比恩波未为阔，此身犹得曳长裾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57074,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潇湘道中 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"清湘浮影动涟漪，寒日收光下翠微。\n回首君亲正无奈，幽禽俄叫不如归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57075,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潇湘道中 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"极目潇湘漾碧澜，万峰插水巧弯环。\n我来日日忘饥坐，却爱真山似假山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57076,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潇湘道中 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"万死犹轻罪有馀，恩容循省但流居。\n潇湘二水相逢处，无复波涛今自如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57077,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月一日","author":"邹浩","text":"杉松无数拥高坟，想见今朝奠酒樽。\n惟我罪深难赦宥，五千里外惨销魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57078,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食日","author":"邹浩","text":"祖考流光岂有穷，不能肖似忝家风。\n北红塔畔清明节，心折高山怅望中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57079,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄花光仁老","author":"邹浩","text":"行尽江湖见尽山，无穷气象杳难攀。\n知师笔有维摩力，为我移来助解颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57080,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"二月八日春气分，忽见梅英枝上繁。\n颠狂索酒醉复醒，知是笔端回化元。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57081,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"岭南消息报来新，正想梅花傍酒樽。\n生出两枝遥寄我，道人方便信多门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57082,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"前年谪向新州去，岭上寒梅正作花。\n今日霜缣玩标格，宛然风外数枝斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57083,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"马祖庵头挂钵囊，晚随缘出住花光。\n僧繇一笔无人会，戏作寒梅自在芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57084,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"解衣盘礴写梅真，一段风流墨外新。\n依约江南山谷里，溪烟疏雨见精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57085,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其六","author":"邹浩","text":"金张许史竞东风，魏紫姚黄醉眼中。\n宾客贵人吾不预，独将清韵照禅宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57086,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁老寄墨梅 其七","author":"邹浩","text":"春晚晴光破雨回，閒将花轴傍檐开。\n炉烟细逐轻风散，疑是香随梅处来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57087,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧慈愿游南华","author":"邹浩","text":"南华老子定相亲，应问三湘放逐臣。\n为报君恩似天地，不教重作岭南人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57088,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冒雪渡江游朝阳火星二岩既归戏作","author":"邹浩","text":"踏雪寻山亦自奇，归来追想欲吟诗。\n孺人顾我忽然笑，却道君今休更痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57089,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"閤门拜表贺君王，数载追陪鹓鹭行。\n郁郁匆匆又元日，望云空断九回肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57090,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"斑衣爵跃为亲寿，岁岁年年兄弟同。\n今日潇湘亦佳节，独将无语对东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57091,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"此身何物比仪形，风里孤蓬水上萍。\n莫道南来无可绩，为谁扶出老人星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57092,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"南来日日望新年，今日新年到眼前。\n笑语妻儿莫惆怅，即随归燕上归船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57093,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"寒雪欻随残臈尽，暖风端逐早春回。\n人间无数芳菲眼，会见乾坤特地开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57094,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其六","author":"邹浩","text":"红梅阁下梅香动，青草湖边草色新。\n鼓枻行将指归路，倚栏犹得会乡人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57095,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其七","author":"邹浩","text":"莫怪今朝雨不休，天工着意在年头。\n尘埃浣涤须教尽，始得风光遍九州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57096,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日 其八","author":"邹浩","text":"版筑何求终见起，金縢不辩自能开。\n君恩滉漾无边际，解逐东风向我来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57097,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼范丞相 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"钟铭勋业今何在，土偶形容尚俨然。\n惟有老僧心不改，慇勤歌呗作三年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57098,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"悼范丞相 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"公骑箕尾归天去，我放江湖继踵来。\n邂逅招提见遗像，尚疑东閤为贤开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57099,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠祖泽长老","author":"邹浩","text":"针芥相投有几人，故人亭畔忽相亲。\n四门开了无它事，笑倚潇湘一片春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57100,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏泽老","author":"邹浩","text":"要识漳州李秀才，无髭无发恶追陪。\n如今熟也君知否，不独江西有大梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57101,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答泽老 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"觌面相呈是此时，了无犹豫与狐疑。\n南山云起北山雨，爵跃掉头吾弗知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57102,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答泽老 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"高山不动白云深，一炷香凝弄水沉。\n欲去复留谁会意，黄鹂枝上啭新音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":57103,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]